{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fanatic of a fictional Christian heresy has a bloody past. Can he find redemption? Become a\u00a0<br>better person? That's up to you: don't kill anybody or kill everybody and see the story unfold. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive dialog: some options will lead to physical confrontations while others to a pacific resolution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spare the life of your opponents or kill them: the choice is yours(It can affect the story).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic party: depending on your choices you might end up with different companions, or even alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic turn based combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different endings: bad ending, pagan ending, christian ending and evil ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand drawn 2d graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Native 2K and 4k sprites and backgrounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21:9 support.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"18e2839486bbde73deddb278a72b5e277b1a1d73.jpg","localized_name":"First kill","name":"First kill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1024720/18e2839486bbde73deddb278a72b5e277b1a1d73.jpg"},{"icon":"cfbe21c24cffe99cff1e8250ce6f1da994c8173c.jpg","localized_name":"Penta kill","name":"Penta kill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1024720/cfbe21c24cffe99cff1e8250ce6f1da994c8173c.jpg"},{"icon":"90e6e56c846355d3d4f827c04030c96382d7c332.jpg","localized_name":"Deca kill","name":"Deca kill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1024720/90e6e56c846355d3d4f827c04030c96382d7c332.jpg"},{"icon":"a295e2cd1d48d724eed905aa41ebb2447b6a87f6.jpg","localized_name":"Massacre","name":"Massacre","path":"http